---
// src/components/storefront/BrandStory.astro
---

<section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-base py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32 border-t border-outline/30">
  
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-0 z-0 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-[0.03] select-none pl-4 sm:pl-10">
    <span class="font-mono font-black text-content leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-size: clamp(8rem, 25vw, 22rem);">
      34%
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-16 md:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-24">
      
      <div class="relative order-2 md:order-1 md:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-center pl-2 sm:pl-0">
        <span class="mb-4 block font-mono text-7xl sm:text-8xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content lg:text-9xl">
          100<span class="text-brand">%</span>
        </span>
        <p class="max-w-[260px] font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-content-muted uppercase leading-relaxed font-bold border-l-2 border-brand/50 pl-5">
          Brand-new products, every order, no exceptions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative order-1 md:order-2 md:col-span-7 flex flex-col min-w-0">
        <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight text-content sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-balance">
          Built for people who refuse to overpay.
        </h2>
        
        <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-content-muted font-medium">
          <p>
            Symeno wasn't founded by retailers. It was founded by analysts who
            realized that global supply chain efficiencies were never reaching
            the end customer.
          </p>
          <p>
            We operate on a simple thesis: Volume is power. By aggregating
            demand and negotiating bulk positions with authorized supply
            partners, we can collapse the retail margin.
          </p>
          <p>
            We don't do flash sales. We don't do fake timers. We provide the
            structural best price, every single day.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-10">
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-brand/40 pb-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-content transition-all hover:border-brand hover:text-brand focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand min-h-[44px]"
          >
            Our Sourcing Ethics <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-2 text-brand">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>